hould-include-feet-clapped-feet-subhuman.1494113/"},{"title":"alternative psl scale imo","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/alternative-psl-scale-imo.1459002/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250815094042/https://looksmax.org/threads/alternative-psl-scale-imo.1459002/"},{"title":"whats a mtn mtb in psl scale","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/whats-a-mtn-mtb-in-psl-scale.1192206/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241113115020/https://looksmax.org/threads/whats-a-mtn-mtb-in-psl-scale.1192206/"},{"title":"much appreciated if i can get a psl rating pre surgery","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/much-appreciated-if-i-can-get-a-psl-rating-pre-surgery.659633/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230208215946/https://looksmax.org/threads/much-appreciated-if-i-can-get-a-psl-rating-pre-surgery.659633/"},{"title":"what is this 63 bbcs girlfriends psl rating i give her an 11 10","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-is-this-63-bbcs-girlfriends-psl-rating-i-give-her-an-11-10.655055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230201020638/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-is-this-63-bbcs-girlfriends-psl-rating-i-give-her-an-11-10.655055/"},{"title":"whats my honest psl rating 23m 511 blonde blue eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/whats-my-honest-psl-rating-23m-511-blonde-blue-eyes.563348/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220908225946/https://looksmax.org/threads/whats-my-honest-psl-rating-23m-511-blonde-blue-eyes.563348/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing - Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Looksmaxxing"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Confidence & presence","chain":["Face rated on 1-8 scale","Shared benchmark of looks","Sets targets for improvement"],"effect":"indirect","text":"Community members use the PSL scale as a shared yardstick to rate male faces and to measure progress from changes such as skin, hair or leanness. The rating gives a concrete target to work toward, and it reflects community opinion rather than a validated measure."},"wikipedia":{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing"},"grokipedia":null,"lead":["The PSL scale, short for Perceived Sexual Levels, is an informal system for rating male facial attractiveness on roughly a 1 to 8 range. Wikipedia reports it was created on three forums, PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net, whose initials form the acronym; the forums are defunct but the terminology spread to wider social media. [1]","Grokipedia, which is AI-generated, describes the scale as based on harmony, dimorphism, angularity and individual features, and as not scientifically validated. [2] No published study has evaluated the scale itself. [1]"],"infobox":[["Full name","Perceived Sexual Levels"],["Range","About 1 to 8 [1]"],["Origin","PUAHate, Sluthate, Lookism.net forums (2010s) [1]"],["Validation","Not scientifically validated [2]"],["Top tiers","Chadlite, Chad, Gigachad [1][2]"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description and tiers","paras":["Wikipedia says the scale was designed to reflect how women perceive men and departs from the conventional out-of-ten rating. Its tiers range from 'subhuman' or sub-3 up to 'giga Chad'. [1] Grokipedia lists below 4 as 'subhuman/truecel', 4.0-5.5 as low to high 'normie', 5.6-6.5 as 'Chadlite', 6.6-7.5 as 'Chad' and 7.6-8 as 'Gigachad', and says most men rate around 3.5-4.5; Wikipedia notes inconsistencies in how its own article describes the tiers. [1][2]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"PSL and appeal","paras":["Looksmax.org users debate how PSL differs from 'appeal'. One thread author says common explanations equate PSL with male-gaze features and appeal with female-gaze harmony and social factors, while noting that long-time members dispute this framing."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Criticism and media coverage","paras":["Wikipedia reports critics describing looksmaxxing as judgmental and linking it to body dysmorphia and suicidal ideation, and a New Yorker writer's objection to tiering people. It also notes that some practitioners report benefits such as improved relationships. [1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found that validate the PSL scale. Research on facial attractiveness exists in the wider psychology literature but does not test this scale. [1]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"PSL is core vocabulary on looksmax.org, where users rate faces and argue over what the scale measures.","claims":[{"claim":"PSL measures facial attractiveness as women perceive it.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"PSL and appeal are different things.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[{"year":"2010s","event":"Scale originates on PUAHate, Sluthate and Lookism.net. [1]"},{"year":"Early 2020s","event":"Terminology spreads to TikTok. [1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Looksmaxxing","source":"Grokipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Looksmaxxing","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Looksmaxxing","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"PSL rating + tips and advice?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-rating-tips-and-advice.1483939/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250809183238/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-rating-tips-and-advice.1483939/"},{"title":"Psl Scale","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale.1410944/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250609150445/https://looksmax.org/threads/psl-scale.1410944/"},{"title":"Psl scale and height","url":"https://looksmax.org